# The sample comic opens with the page to itself: no clock, no bar and no
# position over the art. The middle opens the controls, which say the page.
wait-for Try a sample comic
tap Try a sample comic
wait-for CBZ
tap-at 536,1378
wait-for Available on this reader
tap Open
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
expect-missing Page 1 of
expect-missing Reading
clean
shot reading
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Fit page
expect Page 1 of 4
clean
shot controls
# The controls are grouped: the page's size, its place, and how it is read,
# with the way back to the page at the foot.
expect Page size
expect Zoom 100%
expect Back to the page
# Fit width and the zoom stepper change the page and say so.
tap Fit width
wait-idle
tap-id comic-zoom-in
wait-for Zoom 125%
clean
shot controls-zoomed
tap Back to the page
wait-idle
expect-missing Fit page
clean
shot page-zoomed
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Zoom 125%
tap Fit page
wait-for Zoom 100%
# The page keys turn the comic.
tap Back to the page
wait-idle
tap-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 2 of 4
# All pages shows the pages a few at a time; a tile opens its page.
tap All pages
wait-for Page 1
expect Page 2
tap Next
wait-for Page 4
expect-missing Page 1
clean
shot all-pages
tap Page 4
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 4 of 4
# Go to page takes a number on its own keypad.
tap Go to page
wait-for Enter a page from 1 to 4
clean
shot go-to-page
tap-id comic-digit-3
wait-for 3
tap Go
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 3 of 4
# Reading options: each is a switch that says what it is and shows whether
# it is on.
tap Reading options
wait-for Read right to left
expect Two-page spreads
expect Page on its own
clean
shot reading-options
tap Read right to left
wait-idle
tap Read
wait-idle
# Back on the shelf, the comic says where it was left and how it is read.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for On this reader
expect Saved page 3 of 4
expect right to left
clean
shot shelf-kept
# The place and the direction survive Panels being closed.
restart
wait-for On this reader
expect Saved page 3 of 4
tap A small garden
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 3 of 4
tap Reading options
wait-for Read right to left
tap Read right to left
wait-idle
tap Read
wait-idle
# The shelf says how each comic is read, and says it as soon as it changes,
# not only after the comic is opened again.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for On this reader
expect-missing right to left
